
| Command                                            | Description                               |
| -------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| `docker ps`                                        | List running containers                   |
| `docker ps -a`                                     | List all containers                       |
| `docker images`                                    | List Docker images                        |
| `docker image ls`                                  | List Docker images                        |
| `docker pull <image>`                              | Download Docker image                     |
| `docker run <image>`                               | Run a container                           |
| `docker run -d <image>`                            | Run container in background               |
| `docker run -p HOST:CONTAINER <image>`             | Map host port to container port           |
| `docker run -itd --name webapp01 -p 8080:80 nginx` | Run Nginx container in detached mode      |
| `docker exec -it <container> /bin/bash`            | Access container terminal                 |
| `echo "hello" > /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html`  | Create/modify Nginx web page              |
|  docker info                                       | Display Docker system information         |
|  docker rmi <image_id>                             | Remove Docker image                       |
|  docker rmi -f <image_id>                          | Force remove Docker image                 |
|  docker stop <container>                           | Stop a running container                  |
|  docker image prune -a                             | Remove all unused Docker images           |
|  docker inspect <container_or_image>               | Show detailed container/image information |
